OL,3,GNEWSAMountain railway could resume on
OL,4,AThursday after storms
OL,5,
OL,6,FOperators hope the Isle of Man's
OL,7,FSnaefell Mountain Railway will resume a
OL,8,Fnormal service on Thursday after
OL,9,Foverhead lines were damaged in recent
OL,10,Fstorms.
OL,12,FThe electric railway, which goes to the
OL,13,Fhighest point on the island, closed on
OL,14,FTuesday.
OL,16,FOver the weekend, Storm Boelo and Storm
OL,17,FAusten brought gale force winds, heavy
OL,18,Frain and dangerous waves to the island.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
